Core Components 

Central Topic Registry: Single location defining all available topics (/scene/spawn, /scene/delete, /scene/update_pose)

Unified Publishing Interface: Wrapper function that all code calls to publish, taking topic name as parameter

Lazy Publisher Creation: Publishers instantiated on first use, not at startup

CLI→Topic Mapping Registry: Central definition of which CLI commands publish to which topics (static mapping)

File-Level Service Wait Guards: Subscribers wait for their dependencies before subscribing

Broadcast Architecture: Publishers don't know/care about subscribers; consumers independently interpret commands

Scene State Coordinator:

Central service maintaining authoritative object state
Subscribes to /scene/status topic where spawners publish success/failure
Maintains state dictionary: {object_id: {gazebo: spawned|failed|absent, moveit: spawned|failed|absent, pose: [...], type: ...}}
Publishes state changes to /scene/state_updates
Provides service interface /get_scene_state for queries

Introspection CLI Commands (added to CLI registry):

ros2_system_status --topic X → publishes to /system/query/subscribers → returns active subscribers
ros2_system_publishers --awaiting → publishes to /system/query/publishers → returns publishers with no subscribers
ros2_scene_state --object X → queries Scene State Coordinator → returns object status
ros2_scene_list → queries Scene State Coordinator → returns all objects
